# Raised once more, 11-11, by the CapCut export (docs/capcut.feature): near 56 -> 59. Its real copies were folded
# (io/apple's cf_key reused, runtime-bundle's flag, frames_in shared with render.rs's exposure pass, a PNG read through
# image, the movie writers' frame counts kept once, a byte-concat wrapper gone); the three left match by shape only:
